The objective part 7 is some text that varies. The objective part 7 is "the north. That done, make an effort to go west. After that, make an effort to move west. Next, make an effort to go north. Following that, try to venture north. Then, take a trip east. With that over".
The objective part 8 is some text that varies. The objective part 8 is " with, travel south. Once you get through with that, move south. And then, make an effort to take a trip south. Next, try to move west. If you can manage that, head south. And then, venture west. Afte".
The objective part 9 is some text that varies. The objective part 9 is "r that, try to travel north. Following that, make an effort to venture east. After that, make an attempt to move south. Following that, make an attempt to go to the east. That done, head east. With th".
The objective part 10 is some text that varies. The objective part 10 is "at over with, move south. Then, move south. And then, venture east. And then, go to the east. And then, head north. Then, go to the east. And then, travel east. Then, head south. And then, go to the s".
The objective part 11 is some text that varies. The objective part 11 is "outh. Then, make an effort to take a trip south. Then, head south. Then, move west. Then, make an attempt to move north. With that done, make an attempt to go to the west. After that, try to move sout".
